flowchart TD
    A[SharedAppAssignment] --> B{presentationMode}

    B -->|BACKGROUND| BG[No visible window required]
    BG --> BG2[Observe lifecycle only]

    B -->|SECONDARY_DISPLAY| SD[Resolve display selector]
    SD --> SDG{Display generation current?}
    SDG -->|No| R[Refresh / re-resolve]
    SDG -->|Yes| W[Resolve eligible app window]

    B -->|LOCKED_WINDOW| W
    B -->|OVERLAY| OC{Current game/window context supports overlay?}
    OC -->|No| OUF[OVERLAY_UNAVAILABLE]
    OC -->|Yes| W

    W --> WG{Window generation current?}
    WG -->|No| R
    WG -->|Yes| P[Calculate target bounds / z-order intent]
    P --> S[SetWindowPos / supported user-session operation]
    S --> RB[Fresh bounds/window read-back]
    RB --> V{Presentation predicates reached?}
    V -->|Yes| OK[ACTIVE_VISIBLE / effective presentation]
    V -->|No| D[DRIFTED / PLACEMENT_NOT_REACHED]

    R --> W

    D --> POL{Policy}
    POL -->|bounded retry| P
    POL -->|prompt| UA[User action]
    POL -->|stop fighting app| UM[UNMANAGE / degraded]

    OUF --> ALT[Offer supported alternate presentation]

    classDef note fill:#fff,stroke:#777,stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
    N1[HWND is ephemeral evidence, not persistent identity]:::note
    N2[Presentation failure does not change committed GAME by itself]:::note
    W -.-> N1
    D -.-> N2